{
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": "lists and searches documents",
      "records": {
        "document": [
          {
            "key": "eiffel",
            "value": {
              "title": "The Eiffel Tower",
              "summary": "A wrought-iron tower in Paris.",
              "body": "Built for the 1889 World's Fair."
            }
          },
          {
            "key": "rhine",
            "value": {
              "title": "The Rhine",
              "summary": "A river through six countries.",
              "body": "It flows into the North Sea."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "expect_count": "#documents li",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "fill": "#search",
          "value": "river"
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#documents li",
          "count": 1
        },
        {
          "click": "#documents button"
        },
        {
          "expect_text": "It flows into the North Sea.",
          "selector": "#body"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "renders markdown safely and deletes",
      "open": {
        "collection": "document",
        "key": "doc"
      },
      "records": {
        "document": [
          {
            "key": "doc",
            "value": {
              "title": "Markdown",
              "summary": "Every block type.",
              "body": "## Heading\n\nSome **bold** and *italic* text with `code` and a [link](https://example.com/a).\n\n- one\n- two\n\n1. first\n2. second\n\n> quoted\n\n| a | b |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | 2 |\n\n```\nblock code\n```\n\n<script>alert(1)</script> [bad](javascript:alert(1))",
              "sources": [
                {
                  "url": "https://example.com/source",
                  "label": "Example source"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "expect_text": "Heading",
          "selector": "#body h3"
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body strong",
          "count": 1
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body em",
          "count": 1
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body ul li",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body ol li",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body blockquote",
          "count": 1
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body td",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "expect_text": "block code",
          "selector": "#body pre"
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body a",
          "count": 1
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body script",
          "count": 0
        },
        {
          "expect_text": "<script>alert(1)</script>",
          "selector": "#body"
        },
        {
          "expect_text": "Example source",
          "selector": "#sources"
        },
        {
          "click": "#delete"
        },
        {
          "expect_records": {
            "collection": "document",
            "count": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "does not repeat the title from the body",
      "open": {
        "collection": "document",
        "key": "trip"
      },
      "records": {
        "document": [
          {
            "key": "trip",
            "value": {
              "title": "Packing checklist",
              "body": "# Packing checklist\n\n## Clothing\n\n- Socks"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "expect_text": "Packing checklist",
          "selector": "#title"
        },
        {
          "expect_count": "#body h2",
          "count": 0
        },
        {
          "expect_text": "Clothing",
          "selector": "#body h3"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
